{"id":"415053","name":"羊肉丸子萝卜汤","author":"最初的最美❤","authorId":"10541710","desc":"","cover":"images/415053/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"萝卜","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蛋清","amount":"1个"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"自己剁的羊肉馅，加葱姜末，盐，蛋清，生抽，老抽，胡椒粉，鸡精，耗油，香油，拌匀。","img":"images/415053/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"带一次性手套摔打半个小时。","img":"images/415053/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"做好丸子放在盘子里备用。","img":"images/415053/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好的萝卜。","img":"images/415053/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油下入葱姜炒香下入萝卜片。","img":"images/415053/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加生抽，老抽翻炒均匀。","img":"images/415053/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量水烧开。","img":"images/415053/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入丸子。","img":"images/415053/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小火炖十分钟，加盐，鸡精，十三香，香油调味。","img":"images/415053/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅撒香菜完成。","img":"images/415053/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}